# Pin text files to LF regardless of core.autocrlf. Without this, a checkout
# on a machine with autocrlf=true (this dev machine) can silently flip a
# file's line endings on any operation that touches it (checkout, rebase,
# merge) — which broke both the openapi.yaml freeze hash and a bash-based
# check script's line-flattening in the same session. See
# docs/phases/phase-2.md.
* text=auto eol=lf
